    Looks like travis-ci is not configured for your fork.&lt;br/&gt;
    Please setup by swich on &apos;zeppelin&apos; repository at &lt;a href=&quot;https://travis-ci.org/profile&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://travis-ci.org/profile&lt;/a&gt; and travis-ci.&lt;br/&gt;
