&lt;p&gt;    To trigger CI after setup, you will need ammend your last commit with&lt;br/&gt;
    git commit --amend&lt;br/&gt;
    git push your-remote HEAD --force&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    See &lt;a href=&quot;http://zeppelin.apache.org/contribution/contributions.html#continuous-integration&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://zeppelin.apache.org/contribution/contributions.html#continuous-integration&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
