&lt;p&gt;    Hey guys&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    I finally found why some integration tests fail!&lt;br/&gt;
    In scala 2.11.8 the REPL had been improved a lot. So the tests work well with either scala 2.10 (with SparkJLineCompletion) or scala &amp;gt;=2.11.8 (with cala.tools.nsc.interpreter.JLineCompletion).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    I&apos;ll investigate further to see whether I find a solution for scala 2.11 &amp;lt;=2.11.7.&lt;br/&gt;
    Otherwise I&apos;ll disable the (extended) tests for the scala versions below 2.11.8 (via Assume)&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
